Whitney Hodges: you know, for the Google Ads Accelerator, which I know you kind of, like, raised your hand on, um, that is truly a collaborative approach, right? Where we are giving you access to our strategy, to our recommendations, to our formula for, this is what makes a great ads traffic landing page, like.

