Whitney Hodges: tweaks need to be made essentially. Right? So that's kind of the landing page aspect. What happens in the accelerators? It's kind of like you're doing the work. You're bringing it to us. We're giving you very personalized feedback on it. And if campaigns are running and the page still isn't converting the way that we want it to. It's like, well, we're taking a look at it again. And we're saying, what about this? Let's try this. Let's tweak this sort of thing.

