Whitney Hodges: text nurture, how people kind of go about booking their appointments, which it sounds like you have a lot of built out already in Dubsado. But I think if you were to be open to shifting that into Leadlock, it's just going to be way more data. It's going to look a lot more cohesive. You're going to be able to see and understand exactly what platform each lead is coming from.

