Whitney Hodges: Um, so those are kind of the differences between the two programs. Um, with Elevate, I would say 100%, you're going to want to wait until your rebrand is done to fully dive into that with us, right? So, if that's the route that you want to go, and we want to talk about, you know, kind of like an early.

